<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of Aug 8.</p>
<p>				     Aug 08/Aug 07    Aug 08/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.05		 8.96</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.04		 7.10</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.05		15.27</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.35		59.17</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.26		41.57</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.28		42.21</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.15		19.88</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.15		36.45</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.21		52.45</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.25		50.81</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.18		36.68</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.47	     110.83</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,797,860,638,351</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  2,027,452,341,527</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,404,313,105,952</p>
<p>  International funds			   107,446,496,007</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    258,648,694,866</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
